{"timestamp":"2026-10-08T03:07:39.295Z","ordinal":77040,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac708ef9b0887d08d032df067c92bba","status":"completed","call_id":"call_1d2e708c14074aaa937f3445bf4b5bec","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nimport json\\np=Path('docs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md');s=p.read_text();a=s.index('- Repository check changes must pass');b=s.index('- Keep the development-aware',a)\\ns=s[:a]+'''- Repository check and profile changes must pass the focused type/test/runtime\\n  commands for `check:harness-governance`. They validate repository-owned\\n  findings, task mappings, all six current journeys and external proof limits.\\n  Shared skills are selected through `docs/skills.md`; no current validator\\n  compares a copied collection, profile overlay or global plugin installation.\\n  Historical epoch checks bind their original source and receipts and do not\\n  select today's plugin. Broader semantic Effect/React quality remains a\\n  review responsibility.\\n'''+s[b:];p.write_text(s)\\np=Path('docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json');d=json.loads(p.read_text());changed=[]\\nfor t in d['tasks']:\\n for k,v in t.items():\\n  if isinstance(v,list) and 'bun run test:skills' in v:\\n   t[k]=list(dict.fromkeys('bun run test:harness-governance' if x=='bun run test:skills' else x for x in v));changed.append((t.get('id'),k))\\np.write_text(json.dumps(d,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\nprint('Replaced retired skill-check task commands',changed)\\nPY\\n git add docs/architecture/testing-and-quality.md docs/product-specs/clean-slate-foundation.tasks.json\\n git rm tools/skills/tsconfig.json\\n git commit -m 'merge: combine approved Medicare correction with reviewed rebuild [skip ci]'\",workdir:\"/Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit\",sandbox_permissions:\"require_escalated\",justification:\"Save the resolved Medicare merge and current command/profile reconciliation, replacing only commands removed by the approved main migration.\",prefix_rule:[\"git\",\"commit\"],max_output_tokens:1800,yield_time_ms:1000}));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"rg -n 'subagent|independent|delegate|parallel' /Users/cooper/.codex/plugins/cache/commonplace/development-workflows/0.6.10/skills/prd-implementer/SKILL.md\\n cat docs/skills.md\",workdir:\"/Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit\",max_output_tokens:1900}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11972-d5ef-7ba2-a098-768e70ad3490","create_time":1791428847.6107578}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-08T03:07:39.321Z","ordinal":77041,"type":"token_usage_record","payload":{"thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a11972-d5ef-7ba2-a098-768e70ad3490","session_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","root_turn_id":"01a11972-d5ef-7ba2-a098-768e70ad3490","response_id":"resp_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac708ce851887d0b20deed4e5d1a105","usage":{"input_tokens":185985,"cached_input_tokens":184704,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1391,"reasoning_output_tokens":840,"total_tokens":187376},"turn_token_usage":{"input_tokens":3105375,"cached_input_tokens":3011584,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":15949,"reasoning_output_tokens":7276,"total_tokens":3121324},"thread_token_usage":{"input_tokens":1430987849,"cached_input_tokens":1401296640,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":7164849,"reasoning_output_tokens":3198226,"total_tokens":1438152698}}}
{"timestamp":"2026-10-08T03:07:42.874Z","ordinal":77042,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1055e-4560-7b33-82d2-226827c76159","turn_id":"01a11972-d5ef-7ba2-a098-768e70ad3490","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-a7183c56-04b2-42c2-85ee-e7b600adc080","process_id":"89155","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","rg -n 'subagent|independent|delegate|parallel' /Users/cooper/.codex/plugins/cache/commonplace/development-workflows/0.6.10/skills/prd-implementer/SKILL.md\n cat docs/skills.md"],"cwd":"file:///Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n 'subagent|independent|delegate|parallel' /Users/cooper/.codex/plugins/cache/commonplace/development-workflows/0.6.10/skills/prd-implementer/SKILL.md","query":"subagent|independent|delegate|parallel","path":"SKILL.md"},{"type":"read","cmd":"cat docs/skills.md","name":"skills.md","path":"docs/skills.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"52:closeout. Delegate a bounded task only when it has an independently provable\n54:disjoint writes. Review delegated work and return an incomplete slice to the\n55:same agent before acceptance. Do not use one-subagent-per-task or a fixed number\n59:Every delegated slice states the accepted outcome, exact target revision and\n93:Do not preserve a fixed number of passes, subagents, files, or commands as a\n101:- Keep one-use transformations and typed error handling inline. Extract only reused domain policy, independently testable behavior, or a real I/O boundary.\n177:independent review. Preserve optional work as optional. Do not extend execution\n---\ndocument_type: repository-skill-router\nlifecycle: current\nauthority: canonical\nowner: repository-maintainers\nlast_reviewed: 2026-10-05\nreview_trigger: plugin source, skill routing, or repository profile change\n---\n\n# Development skills\n\nUse the latest published `development-workflows` plugin from the `commonplace`\nmarketplace. Shared skills must not be copied into this repository or linked\nfrom its agent skill folders to a personal installation.\n\n## Resolve the current plugin before starting work\n\n1. Refresh the marketplace and look up the latest published plugin version.\n   The source is [Commonplace Plugins](https://github.com/crcorbett/commonplace-plugins).\n   Check the current [plugin manifest](https://github.com/crcorbett/commonplace-plugins/blob/main/plugins/development-workflows/.claude-plugin/plugin.json)\n   and its matching published release; do not assume an installed cache is current.\n2. Discover the plugin through the current agent's skill list or plugin manager.\n   Compare its version with that lookup and update the installation if it is old.\n   Load the required `development-workflows:<skill-name>` from that installation.\n3. If the latest version cannot be checked or loaded, report that blocker before\n   doing work that requires the skill. Do not fall back to a saved copy, an old\n   cache, a fixed plugin version, or a hard-coded path on someone's computer.\n4. Read the repository profiles below alongside the plugin. They hold local\n   paths and commands; the plugin holds the shared instructions. Record the\n   version used in the task's evidence when a proof record is required.\n\nThis is an agent startup requirement. The old checks for copied shared\nskills have been removed. Code, package and documentation checks remain; they\ndo not prove that an agent refreshed its installation or that an online lookup\nsucceeded.\n\n## Shared skills\n\n- `development-workflows:alchemy-iac`\n- `development-workflows:docs-maintainer`\n- `development-workflows:effect-client-wrapper`\n- `development-workflows:package-structure`\n- `development-workflows:prd-implementer`\n- `development-workflows:prd-review`\n- `development-workflows:prd-writer`\n- `development-workflows:repo-structure`\n- `development-workflows:strict-effect-ts`\n\n## Repository profiles\n\n- [Documentation profile](s