{"timestamp":"2026-10-08T03:10:44.161Z","ordinal":77086,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02692a5b008ee3bd016ac709974eb487d0a31b5f59d78d386c","status":"completed","call_id":"call_23aaee9ec95145e1bbd7f080c6ea75fb","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"python3 - <<'PY'\\nimport json,subprocess,hashlib,datetime\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\nprs=json.loads(Path('/private/tmp/taxkit-merge-open-prs.json').read_text())\\nfor p in prs:\\n subprocess.run(['git','merge-base','--is-ancestor',p['headRefOid'],'HEAD'],check=True)\\nactor=json.loads(Path('/private/tmp/taxkit-merge-actor.json').read_text())\\ndef sha(p):return hashlib.sha256(Path(p).read_bytes()).hexdigest()\\nrecord={\\n 'schemaVersion':'1','status':'inconclusive',\\n 'claim':'Qualify the exact combination of all 81 open TaxKit PR heads with the already merged main changes before the authorised repository merge.',\\n 'target':'crcorbett/taxkit main; integration branch codex/merge-all-20261008',\\n 'candidateIdentity':subprocess.check_output(['git','rev-parse','HEAD'],text=True).strip(),\\n 'actor':'Cooper Corbett approves; Codex executes through GitHub account '+actor['login'],\\n 'authorityReceipt':'Direct human instruction in this chat on 8 October 2026: Merge everything. Approval covers all 81 open TaxKit drafts, ready conversion, conflict resolution, commits/pushes and repository merges for this task. Local checks follow Cooper\\\\'s earlier direction. No package publication, version application, new deployment, billing, credentials, provider mutation or adad source/enablement change is included.',\\n 'environment':'Local Mac validation; GitHub crcorbett/taxkit repository merge; Personal Taxkit Linear tracking',\\n 'journeyIds':['taxkit-calculator-direct','taxkit-sdk-packed','taxkit-http-api','taxkit-docs-runtime','taxkit-release-closure','taxkit-native-website'],\\n 'observations':[\\n 'Fresh open inventory: 81 drafts. The 80-head reviewed rebuild stack remains unchanged; separate Medicare #168 stays at 2051a9870d2ede97ab30d72597c4bc2c90b20d53.',\\n 'Main already contains merged #140 and #153 at b2923793790975dbf619674ed59c768402e8d7d6. Repository allows merge commits and has no active ruleset or protected-main requirement at readback.',\\n 'Local merges resolve 60 main conflicts by preserving approved shared-plugin removals and stable rebuilt toolchain/Effect-native six-journey checks; the one Medicare plan conflict combines the dated scopes. No calculator rule was hand-edited during conflict resolution.',\\n 'Published Commonplace development-workflows manifest and matching release both report 0.6.10; this is the loaded installation. The unauthenticated web source returned 404; authenticated primary GitHub reads verified the manifest and release.',\\n 'Documentation impact: Change required for current checking architecture, profile, plugin profiles, retired task commands and active plan. Preserve accepted runtime/public content/Changesets, six journey oracles, original historical evidence, Entire settings, PostHog/metrics deferrals and consumer/provider limits. N/A for dependency or new tax/provider design changes.',\\n 'The initial focused docs check failed on two references to the retired skill command. The corrected owner passed docs, governance types/tests/runtime. Frozen install, docs/runbooks/format/lint also passed before the complete graph.'\\n ],\\n 'postconditions':['Every one of the 81 recorded PR heads is an ancestor of the integration candidate. Complete combined-source release checks are not yet claimed.'],\\n 'detailArtifacts':[{'path':Path(p).name,'sha256':sha(p)} for p in ['/private/tmp/taxkit-merge-open-prs.json','/private/tmp/taxkit-merge-main-before.json','/private/tmp/taxkit-merge-plugin-manifest.json','/private/tmp/taxkit-merge-commonplace-releases.jsonl','/private/tmp/taxkit-merge-preflight-results.jsonl','/private/tmp/taxkit-merge-preflight-recovery-results.jsonl','/private/tmp/taxkit-merge-qualified-preflight-results.jsonl']],\\n 'limitations':['Combined-source release checks must pass before the requested merge. The earlier separate local checks do not prove this new combination.','GitHub and Linear independent readback own the eventual merge outcome; this receipt currently establishes preparation only.','Merging does not complete T008/T009 or full T010 acceptance. Collection remains off.'],\\n 'nonClaims':['No hosted CI success, package release/publication, package version application, new Preview/Production deployment, provider or credential mutation is claimed.','The exact adad source exception remains 0d82b82d1c48079fc4b8e2ec96abadfe12999789. No independent adad consumer acceptance or calculation enablement is claimed.'],\\n 'rollbackOrRecovery':'Before external merge, discard or revert only this isolated integration branch to the retained handover parent. After merge, prepare a reviewed revert of the actual main merge commit with first-parent selection, preserving the immutable source and receipts. Do not force-push main or change providers.',\\n 'observedAt':datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat()\\n}\\np=Path('docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-08-merge-all.json');p.write_text(json.dumps(record,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\\nprint({'allRecordedHeadsContained':len(prs),'receipt':str(p)})\\nPY\\n git add tools/governance/policy.ts tools/governance/policy.test.ts turbo.json docs/documentation-audit/clean-slate-foundation/2026-10-08-merge-all.json\\n git commit -m 'docs: record merge-all authority and combined source [skip ci]'\",workdir:\"/Users/cooper/.codex/worktrees/aac7/taxkit\",sandbox_permissions:\"require_escalated\",justification:\"Record the exact authorised merge scope, source ancestry, conflict decisions and initial checks in a bounded receipt before the full local validation.\",prefix_rule:[\"git\",\"commit\"],max_output_tokens:1900,yield_time_ms:1000}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a11972-d5ef-7ba2-a098-768e70ad3490","create_time":1791429015.362474}}}
